{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511850/extras/daecdf1f93177b243ce1df37313c13f2.avif?t=1774005341\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511850/extras_big/daecdf1f93177b243ce1df37313c13f2.avif?t=1774005341 width=800 height=160 /></span><strong>   </strong><br><strong>In a world ruled by the demons, a world where even the gods themselves turned their side towards darkness... one man stand and take the quest to restore order. A necromancic named Cyris leaves his homeworld for a strange odyssey through unknown realms, each one more horrible and bizarre than the next in search to destroy the source of the invasion and bring peace back in earth realm.   </strong><br><strong>   </strong><br><strong>Highlights </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 20 huge maps. Travel over many realms, all unique and different from each others</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511850/extras/81b03fee0cb1feff093b23f16cf887b2.poster.avif?t=1774005341\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511850/extras/81b03fee0cb1feff093b23f16cf887b2.webm?t=1774005341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511850/extras/81b03fee0cb1feff093b23f16cf887b2.mp4?t=1774005341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek for secrets, you might find unique and useful items. Gain new ability along the way to help you on your path</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511850/extras/9bae4911e0da7f213f96267fc683cc14.poster.avif?t=1774005341\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511850/extras/9bae4911e0da7f213f96267fc683cc14.webm?t=1774005341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511850/extras/9bae4911e0da7f213f96267fc683cc14.mp4?t=1774005341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay over 40 different enemies, including unique encounters in each map..\u00a0Fight and conquer 20 bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511850/extras/c7de8b04fd549f24d15f48ed4462f584.poster.avif?t=1774005341\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511850/extras/c7de8b04fd549f24d15f48ed4462f584.webm?t=1774005341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511850/extras/c7de8b04fd549f24d15f48ed4462f584.mp4?t=1774005341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig your way through creatures &amp; demons with 7 different weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511850/extras/e6ceb4a7220d673339f4aef43da887cc.poster.avif?t=1774005341\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511850/extras/e6ceb4a7220d673339f4aef43da887cc.webm?t=1774005341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511850/extras/e6ceb4a7220d673339f4aef43da887